<view class="page"><view class="steps">01 日期与场位　→　02 时段　→　<text class="active">03 确认</text></view><view class="title">确认预约</view><view wx:if="{{loadError}}" class="error">{{loadError}}</view><view wx:if="{{venue}}" class="card section"><view class="section-title">{{venue.name}}</view><view class="detail-row"><text>预约日期</text><text>{{selection.date}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>预约时段</text><text>{{selection.timeSlot}}</text></view><view class="detail-row"><text>场地 / 球台</text><text>{{selection.courtNumber}}号{{venue.unit}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">预约须知</view><view class="rules">1. 同一时段仅可保留一条预约。<view>2. 开场前且未核销时可以取消。</view><view>3. 到场后出示核销码，由工作人员核验。</view></view></view><checkbox-group bindchange="agree"><label class="agreement"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#2189e9"/><text>我已阅读预约须知</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{!agreed || submitting || !venue}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting?'正在保存预约…':'确认预约'}}</button></view>
